---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { AUTHOR, GITHUB_URL } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout title="About" description={`About ${AUTHOR} and this blog.`}>
  <div class="prose prose-zinc max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-a:text-accent-600 dark:prose-a:text-accent-400">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p>
      Hi, I'm {AUTHOR}. This blog is my public notebook: I write down what I'm learning,
      the projects I'm building, and the bugs that took me far too long to fix.
    </p>
    <p>
      Writing in public keeps me honest about what I actually understand, and maybe it
      saves someone else a few hours along the way.
    </p>
    <h2>What you'll find here</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Things I learned this week, explained in my own words</li>
      <li>Build logs from side projects</li>
      <li>Tools, setups and workflows I've found useful</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Say hello</h2>
    <p>You can find my code on <a href={GITHUB_URL}>GitHub</a>.</p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
